  "goodToKnow": "Der Historiker (die Historikerin) is a historian. The school subject is Geschichte, which also means story. Germany has a strong tradition of history writing; the Historikerstreit of 1986–87 was a famous public debate about how to remember the Holocaust. Historisch means historic or historical: ein historischer Tag. Don't confuse it with hysterisch (hysterical). The plural stays the same: die Historiker."
